  },
  {
    "id": "c096",
    "name": "21.1.a Verbal Warning",
    "text": "21.1.a. Verbal Warning: In cases where the student is found responsible and the discussion with the administrator, or the hearing before the Board, has been sufcient in and of itself, further action may not be deemed necessary. However, the responsible nding is noted in the student’s record in the Department of Student Rights and Community Standards."
